esenti (piante, animali, oggetti, ecc.).", "short_description": "Vivi un\u2019esperienza immersiva alla ricerca di un misterioso tesoro immerso nel magico mondo di The Seeker! Divertiti a svolgere stimolanti sfide cognitive e metti alla prova le tue capacit\u00e0 di attenzione, memoria, controllo, pianificazione e flessibilit\u00e0.\n\nRiuscirai a trovare il tesoro misterioso?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://the-seeker.it/privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Oculus Store", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://the-seeker.it/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["it"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8782599948511638"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2358567554515605"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2358567554515605"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1745401680, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2358567554515605"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "9065877406850556", "version": "0.2"}, "id": "1123370269472650", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "87654